  "description": {
    "en": "Project of activities about wild animals. The project has 6 parts: \n<ul> \n <li>Mammals </li>\n <li>Fish </li>\n <li>Birds </li>\n <li>Reptiles / others </li>\n <li>Puzzles / word search </li>\n <li>About wild animals </li>\n</ul>",
